    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as a city witch on a journey of battles and truth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wicked Little Witch</strong> is a story-driven, survivor-like action roguelite. You play as an amnesiac witch returning to the enchanted forest to search for your sister, face former friends, and uncover the truth behind your past, your powers, and your fate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00b7 Full story progression</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00b7 Support for more languages</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00b7 At least 15 unlockable characters in the full version</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00b7 4 unique maps with different environments</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00b7 More enemy types and mini-bosses, 14+ story bosses</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00b7 14+ unlockable magic spells</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00b7 Character upgrade system and enhancement shop</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00b7 Collection system (track unlocked characters, artwork, story images, and skills)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thank you to every player brave enough to enter this forest.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as a city witch on a journey of battles and truth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wicked Little Witch</strong> is a story-driven, survivor-like action roguelite. You play as an amnesiac witch returning to the enchanted forest to search for your sister, face former friends, and uncover the truth behind your past, your powers, and your fate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00b7 Full story progression</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00b7 Support for more languages</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00b7 At least 15 unlockable characters in the full version</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00b7 4 unique maps with different environments</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00b7 More enemy types and mini-bosses, 14+ story bosses</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00b7 14+ unlockable magic spells</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00b7 Character upgrade system and enhancement shop</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00b7 Collection system (track unlocked characters, artwork, story images, and skills)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thank you to every player brave enough to enter this forest.</p>",
